Glottal Inverse Filtering (IAIF) — VTL estimation breaks down in extreme pain cry; IAIF restores it
Developmental heterogeneity in φ thresholds — single language emergence threshold needs to be per-cohort (fast vs slow developers)
Lombard Effect correction — current linear approximation should use psychoacoustic literature models
Caregiver learning rate — parents themselves become more accurate over time; the trust system should model this
Cross-cultural prior mixture model — non-Western caregiving contexts need separate research priors (carrying cultures vs crib cultures have different dyadic patterns)
Raw audio deletion decision — 30-day deletion prevents future re-analysis when better models arrive; needs explicit consent architecture for longer retention
GNN message-passing equations — the concept graph GNN recommendation needs full mathematical specification before implementation